<p class="bd" style="margin-top: 24px; max-width: 620px; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.25"><span class="fw">Ваш</span> <span class="fw">клієнт</span> <span class="fw">ухвалює</span> <span class="fw">рішення</span> <span class="fw">на</span> <span class="fw">сотні</span> <span class="fw">тисяч</span> <span class="fw">доларів.</span> <span class="fw">Тому</span> <span class="fw">сайт</span> <span class="fw">має</span> <span class="fw">не</span> <span class="fw">лише</span> <span class="fw">вражати,</span> <span class="fw">а</span> <span class="fw">робити</span> <span class="fw">це</span> <span class="fw">рішення</span> <span class="fw">безпечним</span> <span class="fw">і</span> <span class="fw">вести</span> <span class="fw">від</span> <span class="fw">першого</span> <span class="fw">екрана</span> <span class="fw">до</span> <span class="fw">заявки.</span></p>
